{"reviewId": "200943776_89SpWuAJw", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "全球金融体系越来越需要美国国债作为安全资产，但美国必须不断增加债务才能提供这些资产，而债务增加又会削弱美国国债本身的安全性。这种“必须越来越依赖债务、却又被债务拖累”的矛盾，就是当前美元体系面临的核心悖论。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "31058-31154", "abstract": "这就意味着美国国债发行量将随着全球储备资产需求的扩张而扩张，但债券的发行规模对主权债券的清偿力所产生的负面作用也将越来越大，考虑到发达国家的普遍债务规模和收益率水平，我们正面临一个无解的悖论。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 18, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "200943776_89SpWuAJw", "userVid": 200943776, "topics": [], "createTime": 1781506356, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 200943776, "name": "鳳祥", "avatar": "https://mmhead.c2c.wechat.com/mmhead/LDbDuVBMjdykHMQ1wb9O8ibj9X4dqYJ0QotSvWYq7WVUzXfjLwK7YdDONeD1VOzQT7oAFmGA1kQ8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "医疗", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "活在当下，享受过程", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-2000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 2000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 5, "likes": [{"userVid": 200943776, "name": "鳳祥", "avatar": "https://mmhead.c2c.wechat.com/mmhead/LDbDuVBMjdykHMQ1wb9O8ibj9X4dqYJ0QotSvWYq7WVUzXfjLwK7YdDONeD1VOzQT7oAFmGA1kQ8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "医疗", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "活在当下，享受过程", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-2000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 2000}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "越来越依靠债务，